[Unit]
Description=RANDOM look-alikes of the likes (eight windows of thirty minutes a day, Paris, each clear of the dig's, the fingerprints' and the night site check's runs, and set just after a previews' run can end — they start at :12 and :42 and last twenty minutes at most; the 07:15 window of 7 October waited fifteen minutes on their lock and gave up: the small model judges what the searches around each like bring, alone on the machine)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 01:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 02:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 06:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 07:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 08:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 12:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 16:35:00 Europe/Paris
OnCalendar=*-*-* 22:35:00 Europe/Paris
Persistent=false
RandomizedDelaySec=30

[Install]
